Control the length of excerpt by the number of characters.

== Description ==

Set the maximum length of excerpt by number of characters. Good for Eastern lanaguages such as Thai, Chinese. Whenever you save a post, the excerpt of that post will be set. Please <a href="http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/excerpt-by-characters">[Rate]</a> this plugin.

== Installation ==

1. Upload `excerpt-by-characters.php` to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress
3. Go to Settings>Excerpt by Characters on the admin page. Specify the number of maximum characters and save the setting.
4. Whenever you save a post, the excerpt length of that post will be set.

